  m_text: 'Explore an ocean trench in your full-sized NWH truck. Archimeds supplies
    buoyancy and water drag; propellers steer and propel. Drive/steer retain configured
    keys and triggers. Keyboard ASCEND/DESCEND/SONAR: player1 Q/E/C; player2 PageUp/PageDown/RightCtrl;
    player3 Y/B/V; player4 O/semicolon/P. Hold SONAR with altitude controls to adjust
    ballast. Whole controller: RT/LT forward/reverse, left stick steer, RB/LB ascend/descend,
    D-pad up/down adds/removes ballast, D-pad left/right roll trim, West sonar; right
    stick retains cab free-look. Shared-controller halves: own shoulder ascends,
    own stick-click descends, own trigger ACTION; hold trigger with altitude control
    for ballast. Physical pitch/roll correction keeps the truck upright. ACTION grabs
    treasure actually touching the front cradle; while carrying it releases physical
    cargo; when empty away from cargo it pulses sonar. Sonar discovers real treasure
    within85m, cooldown4seconds. Only carried cargo physically delivered inside the
    lit reception cage under the surface buoy scores. Chests30, gold50, artifacts40,
    cargo25, salvage20 multiply by original depth: every45m adds one tier, at most4x.
    Pickup and sonar score nothing. Pressure damages hull beyond rated depth; ascend
    to recover. Hull failure retires in place and drops cargo, never teleports. AI
    swims, scans, grabs and delivers with the same gates. Rare giant squid encounters
    are animated. Timed matches rank delivered points with shared ties. Shared/chase/cab,
    pause, profiles, disconnect handling and rematch retain original controls.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
